      "details": "<p class=\"p1\">In short, the west side of\u00a0<span><em>Ba\u1e25r-i Mu\u1e25\u012b\u1e6d</em> (the encircling sea) is called\u00a0<span>Ba\u1e25r-i O\u1e33y\u0101n\u016bs. The lands of the <em>Ma\u0121rib</em>\u00a0(West) are on its shore.\u00a0<span>(translated by the creator)</span></span></span></p>",
